A medical rescue and insurance company. If you have a plan with them and suffer so much as a papercut, they'll come running with a bandage and a bill.

Aboard the [[Org/The Harlequins/Providence|Providence]] the company has taken over a long stretch of what was [[Org/Garrick Textiles/index|Garrick Textiles]]' berth, up to the border it shares with the [[Org/The Harlequins/index|Harlequins]]. The [[Org/Protectorate/index|Protectorate]] says Amber Call has been courting the strider's other powers into an alliance against the [[Org/Iridescent Church/index|Iridescent Church]], which it counts its chief target.
